<title>SPAIN: BASKETBALL-YUGOSLAVIA BEAT ITALY IN EURO FINAL.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-YUGOSLAVIA BEAT ITALY IN EURO FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>BARCELONA 1997-07-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final of the European basketball championship on Sunday.</p>
<p>Yugoslavia 61 Italy 49 (halftime 28-23)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Yugoslavia: Dejan Bodiroga 14, Zeljko Rebraca 12, Predrag Danilovic 10, Aleksandar Djordjevic 8, Nikola Bulatovic 6.</p>
<p>Italy: Carlton Myers 17, Gregor Fucka 12, Alessandro Abbio 6, Alessandro Frosini 4, Riccardo Pittis 3, Denis Marconato 3.</p>
</text>
